      },
      "type": "Person"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:7b6a126e7c761dfa",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 426,
        "char_start": 265,
        "episode_id": "5250652d-f8da-5799-91da-8b1ce4991232",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "This episode is brought to you by Squarespace. Squarespace makes building a beautiful, branded website actually pleasant. Get started at squarespace.com/podcast.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 18000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 12000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p08_e02.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:d087ca560a046037",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 520,
        "char_start": 426,
        "episode_id": "5250652d-f8da-5799-91da-8b1ce4991232",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "Before we get into it \u2014 Renee was on last week walking through public-radio voice conventions.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 24000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 18000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p08_e02.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:237866e6b2b9486d",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 714,
        "char_start": 619,
        "episode_id": "5250652d-f8da-5799-91da-8b1ce4991232",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "What does the failure mode look like? What's the version of the question that actually matters?",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 36000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 30000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p08_e02.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:51fc246f0cb104b9",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 977,
        "char_start": 736,
        "episode_id": "5250652d-f8da-5799-91da-8b1ce4991232",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "It comes down to this: Mispronunciation is a high-signal mistake \u2014 it tells listeners 'this person isn't paying attention'. We've seen this play out at teams using BBC. The framing matters because it tells you which trade-offs you're making.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 42000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 36000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p08_e02.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:9b5975507018202d",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 1109,
        "char_start": 996,
        "episode_id": "5250652d-f8da-5799-91da-8b1ce4991232",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "Push back on the conventional wisdom for me. What's something you used to believe about this that you've revised?",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 48000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 42000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p08_e02.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    }
